  "name": "Olive and Feta Pasta",
  "subtitle": "Whole-wheat pasta with vegetables, olives, and feta",
  "description": "A simple vegetarian pasta combining sautéed mushrooms and zucchini with briny olives, oregano, and crumbled feta.",
